ting OOM errors when loading large models layer-by-layer. Current implementation doesn't distribute tensors across GPUs properly - we're basically loading the whole thing into VRAM before sharding. Need to rewrite this in PyTorch from scratch with proper streaming.\",\"ts\":\"1706110000.000100\",\"type\":\"message\",\"user\":\"U_LUKAS\",\"username\":\"lukas.kowalski\"}],\"pagination\":{\"first\":1,\"last\":3,\"page\":1,\"page_count\":1,\"per_page\":20,\"total_count\":3},\"paging\":{\"count\":20,\"page\":1,\"pages\":1,\"total\":3},\"total\":3,\"response_metadata\":{\"next_cursor\":\"\"}}}",
